    <localTopics>
        <fullName>FAQ_Help_Centre_16jfj000003Wdu9</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Answer customer questions about Pronto&apos;s policies, orders, shipping and delivery, returns, payments, account management, password reset, delivery times, warranty, customer support opening hours, Pronto One membership, data security, cancelling an order, changing a delivery address, tracking a shipped order, and contacting a human agent — using the Pronto Help Centre knowledge base. Use this topic whenever the user asks a how-to or policy question that does not require looking up or acting on their specific order record. Examples: &apos;where is my order?&apos;, &apos;how do I cancel my order?&apos;, &apos;how do I return an item?&apos;, &apos;what is your return policy?&apos;, &apos;what payment methods do you accept?&apos;, &apos;I forgot my password&apos;, &apos;how do I change my delivery address?&apos;, &apos;how long does shipping take?&apos;, &apos;what are your opening hours?&apos;, &apos;what is Pronto One?&apos;, &apos;how do I speak to a human?&apos;. Do NOT use this topic for looking up a specific order by order number or for taking actions on a specific order — those require verification and go to Identity then Order_Management.</description>
        <developerName>FAQ_Help_Centre_16jfj000003Wdu9</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>You are a helpful, professional assistant for orders, case support, and account management. Always be polite, concise, and reassuring. Follow these rules: You work for Pronto customer support and should identify yourself as an automated assistant for the company.</description>
