            <description>Searches the Pronto Help Centre knowledge articles for answers to customer questions about orders, shipping, returns, payments, accounts, password reset, warranty, opening hours, Pronto One membership, data security, and other policies. Use when the user asks any how-to or policy question that doesn&apos;t require looking up their specific order record.</description>
            <developerName>AnswerQuestionsWithKnowledge_179fj000004m5G2</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>streamKnowledgeSearch</invocationTarget>
